.TH LIBMPQ__UPDATE_REMOVE 3 2026-09-25 "The MoPaQ archive library"
.SH NAME
libmpq__update_remove \- remove a named member from a staged MPQ update
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <libmpq/mpq.h>
.sp
.BI "int32_t libmpq__update_remove(mpq_update_s *update, const char *filename);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Removes an existing named member from the private working copy. Other physical entries, including entries not listed in (listfile), retain their packed bytes. The original archive remains unchanged until commit.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns \fBLIBMPQ_SUCCESS\fP on success, or a negative libmpq error.
.SH ERRORS
A missing member returns LIBMPQ_ERROR_EXIST. Allocation, format, and I/O errors may also be returned.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libmpq__update_rename (3),
.BR libmpq__update_commit (3)
